Description: T.A.S.K. Mesh Operations - native field station for Meshtastic radios
 A native Qt (PySide6) desktop application for a Raspberry Pi field station.
 Version 0.1.0 connects to a Meshtastic radio over USB serial, shows the
 connection state, the local device and port, and a live table of mesh nodes,
 and stores node data locally in SQLite.
 .
 Bundles the meshtastic Python library 2.7.11 (GPL-3.0-only) privately under
 /usr/lib/task-mesh; all other dependencies come from Debian.
 .
 Development package; not a release artefact.
